        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b) Failure to return to work upon scheduled expiration of approved leave constitutes grounds for termination. Any employee desiring to return to the University after a leave of absence has expired will be treated as a new applicant. All prior seniority will be lost.",
            "block_bbox": [
